        881
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": "BDEL.",
      "text": "I shall get down. And yet, this ‘get down’ deceives many very much. For the jurors order the defendant to get down, then when he has got down, they find him guilty. But none the less I shall get down.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
