        232,
        168,
        283,
        863
      ],
      "margin_number": 2,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἀπεδάκρυσα Philokleon cannot bear to admit that he could pity a defendant, so he has to blame the lentil soup. It must have disagreed with him.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 6,
      "bbox": [
        290,
        168,
        325,
        901
      ],
      "margin_number": 7,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "βελτίω = βελτίονα. Did you recognise this form of the comparative? τά should have provided a useful clue.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 7,
      "bbox": [
        331,
        168,
        381,
        871
      ],
      "margin_number": 9,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ὑστέρῳ Juries filed past two urns: the one they came to first (the earlier or nearer) was for condemnation and the next (the later or further) for acquittal.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 8,
      "bbox": [
        386,
        157,
        400,
        483
      ],
      "margin_number": 14,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "περίπατον Cf. ‘peripatetic’.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 9,
      "bbox": [
        406,
        157,
        439,
        888
      ],
      "margin_number": 21,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "οὐχ ἑκών ‘not willingly’. This has the same meaning as ἄκων ‘unwillingly’ (line 34).",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "vocab_entry",
      "order": 10,
      "bbox": [
        445,
        157,
        477,
        883
      ],
      "margin_number": 22,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἠγωνισάμεθα, See ἀγωνίζομαι. Here it is almost in the sense of ‘to settle a contest’.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
